(7457597, 1181736, 63218, '<td valign="top">I like the way this opens when I click on it.  There''s a sense of movement, of unfolding, that goes very well with that gorgeous blue. I see what it''s a picture of (the subject) only last, which I enjoy.  Thank you.</td>', 'I like the way this opens when I click on it.  There''s a sense of movement, of unfolding, that goes very well with that gorgeous blue. I see what it''s a picture of (the subject) only last, which I enjoy.  Thank you.', '2016-05-31 10:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7457598, 1181757, 63218, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful, an esthetically pleasing combination of colors, shades, shapes, &amp; line with some nice abstract qualities. It would be absolutely stunning if the PP was as good. You may be thinking that the capture as it comes from the camera is what counts (dust spots &amp; all), but I am thinking that the effort to create perfection has to be sustained from first idea right through to the end of PP. JMO of course.</td>', 'This is beautiful, an esthetically pleasing combination of colors, shades, shapes, & line with some nice abstract qualities. It would be absolutely stunning if the PP was as good. You may be thinking that the capture as it comes from the camera is what counts (dust spots & all), but I am thinking that the effort to create perfection has to be sustained from first idea right through to the end of PP. JMO of course.', '2016-05-31 10:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
