(7458096, 1181722, 88506, '<td valign="top">Thanks!<br/>Well, I created another version of this image initially, but changed that later. The reason was that I thought it might violate the rules of standard editing. <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1182227" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/88506/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1182227.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/88506/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1182227.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/88506/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1182227.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>The difference between two images is that I added glowing effect by blending original image with high-pass layer. Is this still standard editing? I whould appreciate if someone can comment on this.</td>', 'Thanks!Well, I created another version of this image initially, but changed that later. The reason was that I thought it might violate the rules of standard editing.    The difference between two images is that I added glowing effect by blending original image with high-pass layer. Is this still standard editing? I whould appreciate if someone can comment on this.', '2016-06-02 13:56:17.000000', NULL, 0),
